{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S01、S05这类短停留段，话语与感受同时出现的内容偏密，纵向交替扫读不如X左右分区利落，个别意象也略显过满。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的优势是左右分区明确，句子完整，短时间内比较容易扫完；但Y用【】突出每段真正的心理转折，又让感受词随音乐进程出现，减少了把所有信息一次读完的压力。尤其在S06至S13，Y对害怕被嫌弃、渴望互相依靠、担心失去、最终不再隐藏心意的因果变化交代得更细，音乐质感与身体感受也更具体。虽然Y有局部堆叠和意象过密的问题，但整体上更能让观众同时听见音乐、理解人物，并感受到这段关系一路发展到结尾的完整过程。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "cef6316a-fac8-467d-8c42-7617773c79f0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T230642186857Z", "elapsed_seconds": 98.203, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:08:20.396276+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "af68070f12a0137f333938ebce931e0c798c9d6f602086789f0f7bfe6a91716a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "t